sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant API as Job API
    participant St as Job store
    participant Sch as Scheduler
    participant W as Worker
    Cl->>API: submit a batch job
    API->>St: materialise every execution row up front
    Note over St: rows exist before work starts, so progress is queryable and restartable
    Sch->>St: claim a batch atomically
    St-->>Sch: leased executions
    Sch->>W: dispatch
    loop each item
        W->>St: mark done, individually
    end
    alt worker dies mid-batch
        St->>St: lease expires, items return to pending
        Note over St,W: only the unfinished items are redone, not the whole batch
    end
    Cl->>API: poll progress
    API->>St: count by state
